<FPNodeTypeWindow name="Configure Frequency Start Stop">
<DOSHelpText/>
<FPPanel functionName="ConfigureFrequencyStartStop">
<FnPos>0</FnPos>
<XPos>1</XPos>
<YPos>17</YPos>
<Height>331</Height>
<Width>558</Width>
<PanelDisabledByDefault>kfpFalse</PanelDisabledByDefault>
<UseScrollBars>kfpFalse</UseScrollBars>
<FunctionQualifier>
</FunctionQualifier>
<HelpText>Configures the frequency range defining its start frequency and its stop frequency. If the start frequency is equal to the stop frequency, then the spectrum analyzer operates in time-domain mode. Otherwise, the spectrum analyzer operates in frequency-domain mode.</HelpText>
<FPCtrl label="Instrument Handle">
<XPos>25</XPos>
<YPos>301</YPos>
<CtrlWidth>145</CtrlWidth>
<ParamPosition>1</ParamPosition>
<CtrlDataTypeIfBuiltIn/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>ViSession</CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>
<HelpText>The ViSession handle that you obtain from the agn934xni_init or agn934xni_InitWithOptions function.  The handle identifies a particular instrument session.

Default Value: None</HelpText>
<FPInputCtrl>
<DefaultValue>
</DefaultValue>
</FPInputCtrl>
</FPCtrl>
<FPCtrl label="Start Frequency">
<XPos>25</XPos>
<YPos>45</YPos>
<CtrlWidth>145</CtrlWidth>
<ParamPosition>2</ParamPosition>
<CtrlDataTypeIfBuiltIn/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>ViReal64</CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>
<HelpText>Sets the start frequency of the frequency sweep (in Hertz).
The driver uses this value to set the AGN934XNI_ATTR_FREQUENCY_START attribute.

Valid Range:

Min:
N9321C, N9322C: 9e3 Hz
N9323C, N9324C: 1e6 Hz

Max:
N9321C: 4e9 Hz
N9322C: 9e3 Hz
N9323C: 1.36e10 Hz
N9324C: 2e10 Hz

Default Value: 0 Hz</HelpText>
<FPInputCtrl>
<DefaultValue>0</DefaultValue>
</FPInputCtrl>
</FPCtrl>
<FPCtrl label="Stop Frequency">
<XPos>387</XPos>
<YPos>45</YPos>
<CtrlWidth>145</CtrlWidth>
<ParamPosition>3</ParamPosition>
<CtrlDataTypeIfBuiltIn/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>ViReal64</CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>
<HelpText>Sets the stop frequency of the frequency sweep (in Hertz).
The driver uses this value to set the AGN934XNI_ATTR_FREQUENCY_STOP attribute.

Valid Range:
Min:
N9321C, N9322C: 9e3 Hz
N9323C, N9324C: 1e6 Hz

Max:
N9321C: 4e9 Hz
N9322C: 9e3 Hz
N9323C: 1.36e10 Hz
N9324C: 2e10 Hz

Default Value: 7e9 Hz</HelpText>
<FPInputCtrl>
<DefaultValue>7e9</DefaultValue>
</FPInputCtrl>
</FPCtrl>
<FPCtrl label="Status">
<XPos>387</XPos>
<YPos>291</YPos>
<CtrlWidth>150</CtrlWidth>
<ParamPosition/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfBuiltIn/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>ViStatus</CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>
