<FPCtrl label="Enable Gate View">
<XPos>80</XPos>
<YPos>45</YPos>
<CtrlWidth>145</CtrlWidth>
<ParamPosition>2</ParamPosition>
<CtrlDataTypeIfBuiltIn/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>ViBoolean</CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>
<HelpText>Enables or disables gate view. The gated view can be enable when the gated sweep is turned on.

The driver uses this value to set the AGN934XNI_ATTR_GATE_VIEW_ENABLE attribute.

Valid Values:
VI_TRUE: Enable
VI_FALSE: Disable

Default Value: VI_FALSE

Command:
[:SENSe]:SWEep:EGATe:VIEW ON|OFF</HelpText>
