The driver uses this value to set the AGN934XNI_ATTR_ATTENUATION attribute.


Valid Range:
Min: 0
Max: 50

Default Value: 20</HelpText>
<FPInputCtrl>
<DefaultValue>20</DefaultValue>
</FPInputCtrl>
</FPCtrl>
