<XPos>80</XPos>
<YPos>128</YPos>
<CtrlWidth>145</CtrlWidth>
<ParamPosition>5</ParamPosition>
<CtrlDataTypeIfBuiltIn/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>ViBoolean</CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>
<HelpText>Enables or Disables beep warning for limit.

The driver uses this value to set the AGN934XNI_ATTR_POWER_METER_LIMIT_BEEP_ENABLE attribute.

Valid Values:
