The driver uses this value to set the AGN934XNI_ATTR_POWER_METER_GATE_START_TIME attribute.

Valid Range:
Min: -1 s
Max: 1 s

Default Value: 0 s

Command:
[:SENSe]:SWEep[1]:OFFSet:TIME &lt;value&gt;

</HelpText>
<FPInputCtrl>
<DefaultValue>0</DefaultValue>
</FPInputCtrl>
</FPCtrl>
