<FPNodeTypeWindow name="Configure Reflection Measurement Distance">
<DOSHelpText/>
<FPPanel functionName="ConfigureReflectionMeasurementDistance">
<FnPos>0</FnPos>
<XPos>1</XPos>
<YPos>17</YPos>
<Height>331</Height>
<Width>558</Width>
<PanelDisabledByDefault>kfpFalse</PanelDisabledByDefault>
<UseScrollBars>kfpFalse</UseScrollBars>
<FunctionQualifier>
</FunctionQualifier>
<HelpText>Configures the Distance Unit, Start Distance Point and Stop Distance Point for reflection measurement.

Notes:
(1) This function is applicable for N9321C, N9322C, N9323C and N9324C models.
(2) Valid only when Reflection Measurement Type is Distance to Fault Measurement.</HelpText>
<FPCtrl label="Instrument Handle">
<XPos>25</XPos>
<YPos>301</YPos>
<CtrlWidth>145</CtrlWidth>
<ParamPosition>1</ParamPosition>
<CtrlDataTypeIfBuiltIn/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>ViSession</CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>
<HelpText>The ViSession handle that you obtain from the agn934xni_init or agn934xni_InitWithOptions function.  The handle identifies a particular instrument session.

Default Value: None</HelpText>
<FPInputCtrl>
<DefaultValue>
</DefaultValue>
</FPInputCtrl>
</FPCtrl>
<FPCtrl label="Distance Unit">
<XPos>25</XPos>
<YPos>45</YPos>
<CtrlWidth>145</CtrlWidth>
<ParamPosition>2</ParamPosition>
<CtrlDataTypeIfBuiltIn/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>ViInt32</CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>
<HelpText>Selects the distance unit between meter and feet.

The driver uses this value to set the AGN934XNI_ATTR_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISTANCE_UNIT attribute.

Valid Values:
AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISTANCE_UNIT_METERS: Meters
AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISTANCE_UNIT_FEET: Feet

Default Value: AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISTANCE_UNIT_METERS

Command:
[:SENSe]:CAT:DISTance:UNIT METers|FEET</HelpText>
<FPRingCtrl>
<DefaultIndex>0</DefaultIndex>
<LabelValue label="Meters">AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISTANCE_UNIT_METERS</LabelValue>
<LabelValue label="Feet">AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISTANCE_UNIT_FEET</LabelValue>
</FPRingCtrl>
</FPCtrl>
<FPCtrl label="Start Distance Point">
<XPos>206</XPos>
<YPos>45</YPos>
<CtrlWidth>145</CtrlWidth>
<ParamPosition>3</ParamPosition>
<CtrlDataTypeIfBuiltIn/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>ViReal64</CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>
<HelpText>Sets the value for  Start Distance Point.

The driver uses this value to set the AGN934XNI_ATTR_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISTANCE_START attribute.

Valid Range:
Min: 0 m
Max:stop distance: 0.1 m

Default Value: 0.82 m

Command:
[:SENSe]:CAT:DISTance:STARt &lt;distance&gt;</HelpText>
<FPInputCtrl>
<DefaultValue>0.82</DefaultValue>
</FPInputCtrl>
</FPCtrl>
<FPCtrl label="Stop Distance Point">
<XPos>387</XPos>
<YPos>45</YPos>
<CtrlWidth>145</CtrlWidth>
<ParamPosition>4</ParamPosition>
<CtrlDataTypeIfBuiltIn/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>ViReal64</CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>
<HelpText>Sets the value for  Stop Distance Point.

The driver uses this value to set the AGN934XNI_ATTR_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISTANCE_STOP attribute.

Valid Range:
Min: Start distance + 0.1 m
Max: N/A

Default Value: 9.89 m

Command:
[:SENSe]:CAT:DISTance:STOP &lt;distance&gt;</HelpText>
<FPInputCtrl>
<DefaultValue>9.89</DefaultValue>
</FPInputCtrl>
</FPCtrl>
<FPCtrl label="Status">
<XPos>387</XPos>
<YPos>291</YPos>
<CtrlWidth>150</CtrlWidth>
<ParamPosition/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfBuiltIn/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>ViStatus</CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>
