<FunctionQualifier>
</FunctionQualifier>
<HelpText>Configure the Channel Integrate Bandwidth, Center Frequency, Channel Span, Auto Total Power Reference State, Total Power Reference, Auto Resolution Bandwidth State and Resolution Bandwidth for SEM measurement.</HelpText>
