<YPos>45</YPos>
<CtrlWidth>145</CtrlWidth>
<ParamPosition>2</ParamPosition>
<CtrlDataTypeIfBuiltIn/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>ViReal64</CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>
<HelpText>Sets reference channel integrate bandwidth in SEM measurement.

The driver uses this value to set the AGN934XNI_ATTR_SEM_CHANNEL_INTEGRATE_BANDWIDTH attribute.


Valid Range:
Min: 100 Hz
Max: 5e6 Hz

Default Value: 3.84e6 Hz

