<YPos>45</YPos>
<CtrlWidth>145</CtrlWidth>
<ParamPosition>3</ParamPosition>
<CtrlDataTypeIfBuiltIn/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>ViReal64</CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>
<HelpText>Sets center frequency in SEM measurement.

The driver uses this value to set the AGN934XNI_ATTR_SEM_CENTER_FREQUENCY attribute.


Valid Range:
Min: 1.25e7 Hz
Max: 2e+10 Hz

Default Value: 1.5e9 Hz

Command:
[:SENSe]:SEMask:FREQuency:CENTer &lt;freq&gt;</HelpText>
<FPInputCtrl>
<DefaultValue>1.5e9</DefaultValue>
</FPInputCtrl>
</FPCtrl>
