<CtrlDataTypeIfBuiltIn/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>ViReal64</CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>
<HelpText>Sets the normalization level.
The driver uses this value to set the AGN934XNI_ATTR_TG_NORMALIZE_REFERENCE_LEVEL attribute.

Units: 

Valid Range:
Min: -327.6
Max: 327.6

Default Value: 0</HelpText>
<FPInputCtrl>
<DefaultValue>0</DefaultValue>
</FPInputCtrl>
</FPCtrl>
<FPCtrl label="Normalize Reference Position">
<XPos>387</XPos>
