AGN934XNI_VAL_INSTRUMENT_SETTING_FREQUENCY_START: Frequency Start
AGN934XNI_VAL_INSTRUMENT_SETTING_FREQUENCY_STOP: Frequency Stop
Default Value: AGN934XNI_VAL_INSTRUMENT_SETTING_FREQUENCY_CENTER</HelpText>
