<YPos>45</YPos>
<CtrlWidth>145</CtrlWidth>
<ParamPosition>3</ParamPosition>
<CtrlDataTypeIfBuiltIn/>
<CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>ViInt32</CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>
<HelpText>Selects the parameter which is provided to be compatible with IVI specification, setting this parameter has no influence on the connected instrument.

Valid Values:
AGN934XNI_VAL_VIDEO_TRIGGER_SLOPE_POSITIVE
AGN934XNI_VAL_VIDEO_TRIGGER_SLOPE_NEGATIVE

Default Value: 
AGN934XNI_VAL_VIDEO_TRIGGER_SLOPE_POSITIVE</HelpText>
