The driver uses this value to set the AGN934XNI_ATTR_ACTIVE_TRACE attribute.

Valid Range:
"TRACE1": Trace 1
"TRACE2": Trace 2
"TRACE3": Trace 3
"TRACE4": Trace 4


Default Value: ""</HelpText>
<FPInputCtrl>
<DefaultValue>""</DefaultValue>
</FPInputCtrl>
</FPCtrl>
