<CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>ViChar[]</CtrlDataTypeIfUserDefined>
<HelpText>If the attribute is repeated capability-based, this parameter specifies the name of the repeated capability on which to set the value of the attribute. If the attribute is not repeated capability-based, then pass VI_NULL or an empty string.

Valid Repeated Capability Names:

Default Value: ""
</HelpText>
<FPInputCtrl>
<DefaultValue>""</DefaultValue>
</FPInputCtrl>
